# Baseline medium cannon (the former hardcoded "Ballistic Cannon").
# Damage-per-capacitor ~3.75: the reference point the rest of the catalog is tuned against.
id          gauss_mk1
name        "Gauss Cannon Mk I"
kind        ballistic
size        M
icon        ic-cannon
damage      15
fire_rate   5.0
proj_speed  12000
proj_life   20
proj_radius 4.0
cap_cost    4
emission    0.6
proj_hp     1.0
price       400
tier        1

# In-world turret art (407x659, barrel-up). Height 3.00 half-extents matches the axial
# footprint of the procedural turret it replaces; width follows the art's aspect ratio.
# The pivot is negative because the housing this thing rotates about sits aft of the
# quad's centre -- the quad also has to contain the barrel.
mount_art       assets/weapons/assets/tier_1_cannon_single_barrel.png
mount_art_size  1.85 3.00
mount_art_pivot -0.32

# One barrel, measured off the art's alpha (cols 209..242 of 407, tip at row 0) and sitting
# slightly right of centre because the art draws it that way.
muzzle 0.10 1.82
desc "The workhorse medium cannon of the frontier. Nothing it does is exceptional; everything it does is dependable."
